{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31315","headline":"伤曾秀才马 · 刘威","name":"伤曾秀才马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"买得龙媒越水濆，轻桃细杏色初分。\n秋归未过阳关日，夜魄忽销阴塞云。\n吴练已知随影没，朔风犹想带嘶闻。\n临轩振策休惆怅，坐致烟霄只在君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}